{"id":"jeunesse","lemma":"jeunesse","pos":"noun","rank":2030,"glosses":["youth"],"ipa":"/ʒœ.nɛs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/50/Fr-jeunesse.ogg/Fr-jeunesse.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"jeunesses"},"formAudio":{"jeunesses":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-jeunesses.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ça me rappelle ma jeunesse.","en":"It reminds me of my youth.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to call again","l":"rappeler"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},null]},{"text":"Ah, la jeunesse.","en":"Ah, to be young again.","words":[{"g":"ah"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Nous devrions tenir compte de sa jeunesse.","en":"We should take his youth into account.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"to take into account"]]},{"text":"La jeunesse est gaspillée par les jeunes.","en":"Youth is wasted on the young.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"through"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"young","l":"jeune"}]},{"text":"Sa jeunesse lui a été dérobée.","en":"He was robbed of his youth.","words":[{"g":"his"},null,{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"concealed","l":"dérobé"}]}]}